// CHECK-NEXT: line 0 (5): first
// CHECK-NEXT: line 1 (66): the second line, which is longer than the first one by quite a bit
// CHECK-NEXT: line 2 (5): third
// CHECK-NEXT: line 3 (0): 
// CHECK-NEXT: longest: the second line, which is longer than the first one by quite a bit
// CHECK-NEXT: a note of 94 bytes
// CHECK-NEXT: a note of 0 bytes
